# A frozen SQLite fixture must never ship its WAL sidecars. Opening the database --
# even read-only, as the tests do -- creates them, so `git add -A` sweeps them in.
# A committed stale WAL is replayed by SQLite on the next open, which silently changes
# the fixture's contents depending on who ran the tests last.
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-shm
